sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Navegador (React)
    participant A as Backend Express
    participant C as Caché (NodeCache)
    participant G as CoinGecko
    participant X as Binance
    participant R as RSS CoinDesk/Cointelegraph

    B->>A: GET /api/market/top?limit=20
    A->>C: cache.get("market:top:20")
    alt cache hit
        C-->>A: datos en caché
    else cache miss (single-flight)
        A->>G: /coins/markets (timeout 10s, retry 2)
        G-->>A: 20 monedas
        A->>C: cache.set(90s TTL)
    end
    A-->>B: JSON normalizado

    B->>A: GET /api/market/bitcoin/history?days=7
    A->>A: ¿pertenece a Binance?
    alt Binance soportado
        A->>X: /klines (timeout 8s)
        X-->>A: velas OHLCV
    else fallback
        A->>G: /coins/bitcoin/market_chart
    end
    A->>C: cache.set(300s TTL)
    A-->>B: JSON {source, prices[]}

    B->>A: POST /api/analysis/market
    A->>A: generateMarketAnalysis()
    A->>G: getTopCoins()
    A->>R: getNews() (Promise.all)
    R-->>A: 30 noticias
    A->>A: análisis por reglas (sentimiento + tendencia)
    A->>C: cache.set(900s TTL)
    A-->>B: resumen + disclaimer

    Note over B,A: Sin autenticación — todos los endpoints son públicos y de solo lectura